<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Update on Your Mentor Application</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f4f7f6;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
        }
        .email-wrapper {
            width: 100%;
            background-color: #f4f7f6;
            padding: 40px 0;
        }
        .email-container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 8px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .header {
            background-color: #4F46E5; /* SkillForge Indigo */
            padding: 40px 30px;
            text-align: center;
            color: #ffffff;
        }
        .header h1 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }
        .body-content {
            padding: 40px 30px;
            color: #333333;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        .body-content h2 {
            font-size: 22px;
            color: #1f2937;
            margin-top: 0;
            font-weight: 600;
        }
        .body-content p {
            font-size: 16px;
            color: #4b5563;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .status-badge {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: #FEE2E2; /* Light Red */
            color: #991B1B; /* Dark Red */
            padding: 6px 16px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }
        .feedback-box {
            background-color: #F9FAFB; /* Light Gray */
            border-left: 4px solid #6B7280; /* Gray Border */
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            margin: 25px 0;
            color: #374151;
        }
        .feedback-title {
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #1f2937;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            font-size: 15px;
        }
        .feedback-content {
            font-style: italic;
            margin: 0;
        }
        .footer {
            background-color: #f9fafb;
            padding: 25px 30px;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #9ca3af;
            border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
        }
        .footer p {
            margin: 5px 0;
        }
        .footer a {
            color: #4F46E5;
            text-decoration: none;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="email-wrapper">
        <div class="email-container">
            <!-- Header -->
            <div class="header">
                <h1>Application Update</h1>
            </div>

            <!-- Body -->
            <div class="body-content">
                <h2>Hello <%= locals.name ? name : 'Applicant' %>,</h2>
                
                <p>Thank you for taking the time to apply as a Mentor at SkillForge. We truly appreciate your interest in guiding our community.</p>
                
                <div class="status-badge">Application Not Approved</div>

                <p>After carefully reviewing your profile, portfolio, and experience, our team has decided that we cannot move forward with your mentor application at this time.</p>
                
                <!-- Feedback/Reason Box -->
                <div class="feedback-box">
                    <div class="feedback-title">Feedback from our review team:</div>
                    <p class="feedback-content">
                        "<%= locals.reason ? reason : 'While your background is impressive, we are currently looking for mentors with more specific industry experience matching our current curriculum needs.' %>"
                    </p>
                </div>

                <p>We know this might be disappointing news, but this is not a permanent decision. We highly encourage you to continue building your skills, updating your portfolio, and re-applying in the future.</p>
                
                <p>In the meantime, your account remains fully active, and you can continue to enjoy full access to SkillForge as a Learner.</p>
                
                <p style="margin-top: 40px; margin-bottom: 0;">
                    Best Wishes,<br>
                    <strong style="color: #1f2937;">The SkillForge Team</strong>
                </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Footer -->
            <div class="footer">
                <p>&copy; 2026 SkillForge. All rights reserved.</p>
                <p>Have questions? Contact our <a href="mailto:support@skillforge.com">Support Team</a></p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>